cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Onyx
abstract: >-
  An interchange format for a personal food and body-weight diary, with a
  conformance corpus and a reference engine. Addresses the absence of any
  interchange format for consumer nutrition logging: Open mHealth and
  IEEE 1752 cover body weight, activity and sleep across hundreds of schemas
  and define none for food, and HL7 FHIR NutritionIntake is modelled on
  inpatient tray monitoring rather than self-recorded diaries.
message: >-
  If you reference this specification in research or in another
  specification, please cite it as below.
